    timeframe should be smaller and lighter
    description should be short and easy to scan
    
    Recommended visual hierarchy:
    
    Section heading = largest
    Step title = medium bold
    Timeframe = smaller accent text
    Description = regular body text
    Disclaimer
    
    Add this small text centered underneath the 3 steps:
    
    Everyone responds differently. For best results, take two capsules consistently 30–60 minutes before bed.
    
    Make this subtle, smaller, and easy to read.
    
